261
00:18:57,730 --> 00:19:03,270
November 27th marked two years of the Bal Vivah Mukt Bharat campaign,

262
00:19:03,320 --> 00:19:07,520
launched by the Ministry of Women and Child Development in 2024.

263
00:19:07,570 --> 00:19:12,500
It aims to cut child marriage by 10% by 2026.

264
00:19:12,550 --> 00:19:16,700
And to make India free of child marriage by 2030.

265
00:19:16,750 --> 00:19:21,220
The law behind it is the Prohibition of Child Marriage Act of 2006.

266
00:19:21,270 --> 00:19:26,330
It sets the age of marriage at 18 for girls and 21 for boys,

267
00:19:26,380 --> 00:19:31,520
and every state appoints Child Marriage Prohibition Officers

268
00:19:31,570 --> 00:19:38,140
to stop child marriages. A bill to raise the age for girls to 21 was introduced in 2021.

269
00:19:38,190 --> 00:19:42,450
